        "Angle misclosures are hidden by force-fitting round numbers instead of distributing the residual, and examiners spot it instantly. Distance work trips on slope, measuring along the slope and reporting it as horizontal. In {S} submissions, state the corrections applied and the closure achieved, because unstated work is unverifiable work. A slope note beside each taped line is cheap insurance.",
