        "Timed drills on past papers build the last skill: convert scales, compute plot ratios and densities, adjust traverses, then draft an essay with named Nigerian examples. In {S} revision, mark yourself against the scheme of assessment, not the clock alone, because method marks follow the working. Two full papers under the clock calibrate speed better than any timer.",
